---
import { Image } from 'astro:assets';
import aboutImage from '../assets/images/about.png';
import '../styles/about.scss';
---

<section class="about" id="about">
  <div class="about-container">
    <div class="about-content">
      <h2 class="about-title">About</h2>
      <p class="about-text">
        Hi, I’m Emma s’Jacob violinist, educator, health/well-being coach and sole founder of ‘Bravura’ coaching. I believe in nurturing the soul and reigniting brain function through instrumental music tuition. It is well documented that exposure to music, whether it be through listening or playing preserves and restores cognitive agility helping to stave off the corrosive effects of neurodigenerative diseases. Come and experience the therapeutic power of music through string playing.
      </p>
    </div>
    <div class="about-image">
      <Image src={aboutImage} alt="About Bravura Coaching" />
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
